'''Pryce's office''' was the office of [[Governor]] [[Arihnda Pryce]].<ref name="Jedi Night" /> Pryce preferred to keep her office sparsely decorated as it was a place to conduct business instead of a place where she could relax.<ref name="Thrawn">[[Thrawn (novel)|''Thrawn'']]</ref> Pryce used her office until her [[death]] during the [[Liberation of Lothal]]<ref name="Family&Farewell">{{Rebels|Family Reunion &ndash; and Farewell}}</ref> in [[1 BBY]].<ref name="Liberation date" />

